Z||000014||RZURCTN||11-26-1999||01:16 AM||||I'm asking $1500.  It is negotiable.  The car needs work and I'm waiting to get the title for it.  It runs good and I'm sure that it would make it there.  But it is a European model, hence, no emissions.  But it puts out more hp than U.S. models.||||reg||1
